algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: BellmanFord(w, source)
Input: weight matrix w[n×n], source node s
Output: shortest distances d[n], predecessor p[n]

d ← [∞, ..., ∞]; d[s] ← 0; p ← [-1, ..., -1]
for step = 1 to n-1:
    updated ← false
    for j = 0 to n-1:
        for i = 0 to n-1:
            if d[i] + w[i][j] < d[j]:
                d[j] ← d[i] + w[i][j]
                p[j] ← i
                updated ← true
    if not updated: break
return (d, p)

Time: O(n³), Space: O(n)
